  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 6 ranks, Herbalism sphere.</p>\n<p>You reduce the herb cost of any concoction you create by 1 (minimum 1). In addition, you may spend 1 use of skill leverage to gather a batch of herbs and prepare concoctions in the same 15 minute period. These concoctions may be prepared using herbs gathered from this batch. Also, you gather batches of herbs twice as fast.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
